      "content": "electrical gremlin? lol i mean i guess i see what u mean but i'm looking for something more concrete than that. if it is a sensor problem, would that cause spikes that massive on the scan tool? or could it be something internal physically messing with the valve body, like a piece of debris that just gets caught in the wrong spot and then clears itself out? i'm worried i'm gonna have to drop the whole thing just to find a tiny piece of junk.",
